prosecutors have dropped all charges  against former las vegas raider damon  arnett he's accused of pointing a gun at  a strip employee in january he faced  multiple charges including assault with  a deadly weapon today  all those charges were dropped but  that's not the end for arnett according  to miami police he was arrested late  monday night for driving on a suspended  license he was cited and released three  hours later he was stopped again  during the search police report finding  a small bag of white powdery substance  believed to be cocaine now arnett is  facing multiple charges of drug  possession
 

